      <activity id="c21af928-6012-5e8e-8b35-cc4edb173251" activityNameId="f8f68144-9df5-589e-a416-9ec6a5d74d2e" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Transport, natural gas, onshore pipeline, long distance</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Transport, natural gas, onshore pipeline, long distance
Infrastructure requirements are based on estimated standard capacity. UUID=6fd52065-29fc-3da7-92ed-4e3238dae38e
This dataset describes the energy consumption and the emissions linked to the transport of Turkmen natural gas in an onshore pipeline.
Location: The data for emissions are based on European data and for energy requirements on German data.
Technology: Long-distance transport onshore with  average compressor station.
Time period: The data for emissions is from 2006, the data for energy requirements from 2001
Production volume: not known
Sampling: Literature.
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_6fd52065-29fc-3da7-92ed-4e3238dae38e.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="3a2b3531-c866-5075-ba62-212e945b1c1a" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
